    "conditions": "斜线$l$与平面$\\alpha$斜交，$l$在$\\alpha$内的射影为$l'$，$m$是$\\alpha$内过斜足的任意直线。$\\theta_1,\\theta_2,\\theta$均取锐角。",
    "conclusions": "1. $\\cos\\theta = \\cos\\theta_1 \\cdot \\cos\\theta_2$。2. $\\theta \\ge \\theta_1$，当$m$与$l'$重合时取等。"
